  "description": "Mariel Peridenver can’t wait to attend the emperor’s birthday party—but not because she cares about the emperor. Her only goal is to confess her love to the man of her dreams, the dashing Sir Resnor, and have her way with him! But when the clock strikes 10, something strange happens: Mariel is seized with uncontrollable desire, making her desperate to jump into bed with someone… anyone! Can Mariel satisfy her lust, shake off this raunchy curse, and still achieve a happy ending with her dream guy?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Includes four extra chapters.*",
